  "question": {
    "text": "If the root mean square velocity of hydrogen molecule at a given temperature and pressure is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi>km</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> the root mean square velocity of oxygen at the same condition in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>km</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Root mean square velocity is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo> </mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo> </mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi>km</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
